Subject: [PATCH] Verify native HDR delivery and restore output contracts

SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later

Use live driver receipts and clear rejected dynamic metadata. Separate
strict HDR depth from the byte-preserving DV and ordinary SDR states.

